Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,of body or heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,to God tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:04.20,0:00:05.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,and rest in his care
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.79,0:00:07.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,while you sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:08.04,0:00:09.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,If your body is hurting,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.88,0:00:11.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,or your heart is,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.18,0:00:13.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,stay with me for the next
Dialogue: 4,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,few minutes.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.20,0:00:16.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Take one slow breath with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:16.85,0:00:18.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lie down and let the bed
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.79,0:00:20.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,hold your weight.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.34,0:00:21.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your hands rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:21.89,0:00:23.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,your jaw soften,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:23.14,0:00:24.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,your breathing slow.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:24.87,0:00:27.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may be tired of being sick,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:27.33,0:00:29.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,tired of waiting for results,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:29.63,0:00:31.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,tired of carrying sorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.79,0:00:33.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring all of it here.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.78,0:00:34.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have
Dialogue: 4,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be strong tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.83,0:00:39.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,The prophet Jeremiah
Dialogue: 4,0:00:39.32,0:00:41.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,prayed this simple prayer.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.78,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Heal me, O LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.78,0:00:44.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I shall be healed;
Dialogue: 5,0:00:44.82,0:00:45.49,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}save me,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:45.49,0:00:47.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I shall be saved:
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.42,0:00:50.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for thou art my praise.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:51.38,0:00:54.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jeremiah's prayer is short and honest.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:54.63,0:00:57.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,He does not explain or perform.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.48,0:00:59.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,He simply asks.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:59.38,0:01:02.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight you can pray the same way.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:02.23,0:01:04.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need the right words.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.95,0:01:06.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,You only need to bring
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,yourself to the One who heals.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:09.74,0:01:11.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,So let us pray.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:11.65,0:01:12.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:12.05,0:01:13.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,here I am at the end
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.62,0:01:14.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,of this day,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:14.57,0:01:16.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,with my body and my heart
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.54,0:01:18.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,just as they are.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:18.06,0:01:19.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,You know every ache,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:19.72,0:01:20.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,every symptom,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:20.88,0:01:22.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,every fear I have
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.29,0:01:23.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,not said out loud.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:23.96,0:01:26.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Heal me, O Lord.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:26.06,0:01:28.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold me tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:29.04,0:01:31.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,He healeth the broken in heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:31.48,0:01:34.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,and bindeth up their wounds.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:35.37,0:01:37.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,The same psalm says God counts
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.79,0:01:39.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,the stars and calls
Dialogue: 4,0:01:39.33,0:01:40.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,them all by name.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:40.88,0:01:42.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,And yet he bends down
Dialogue: 4,0:01:42.57,0:01:44.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,to bind up wounds,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:44.01,0:01:46.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,like a nurse tending a bandage.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:46.67,0:01:49.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,The God of the galaxies is gentle
Dialogue: 4,0:01:49.36,0:01:51.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,with your hurt tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:52.62,0:01:55.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father, I bring you my body.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:55.25,0:01:56.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where there is pain,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:56.78,0:01:57.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring relief.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:57.95,0:02:00.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where there is inflammation,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.14,0:02:01.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring calm.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:01.18,0:02:02.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where there is sickness,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:02.83,0:02:04.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring your healing touch.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:04.73,0:02:07.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Strengthen my immune system,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:07.01,0:02:08.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,steady my heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:08.32,0:02:10.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,and restore what is worn out.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.86,0:02:13.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my body rest deeply tonight
Dialogue: 4,0:02:13.14,0:02:15.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,and heal while I sleep.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:16.21,0:02:18.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD will strengthen him
Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.25,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}upon the bed of languishing:
Dialogue: 5,0:02:20.25,0:02:21.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou wilt make all
Dialogue: 5,0:02:21.68,0:02:23.93,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his bed in his sickness.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.26,0:02:26.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thou wilt make all
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.69,0:02:28.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,his bed in his sickness.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.77,0:02:30.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,What a tender picture:
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.76,0:02:33.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,God himself arranging the pillows,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:33.19,0:02:34.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,smoothing the sheets
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.62,0:02:36.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the one who is ill.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.44,0:02:39.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are not forgotten in that bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.18,0:02:40.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,He is there.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:41.91,0:02:44.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, I thank you for doctors,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:44.37,0:02:44.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,nurses,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:44.94,0:02:46.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,medicine and every person
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.99,0:02:49.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,whose work helps us heal.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:49.22,0:02:50.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give them wisdom,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,skill and compassion.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:52.53,0:02:55.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide every decision about treatment.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the medicine work as it should.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.56,0:03:00.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,And help me to keep following
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.50,0:03:02.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,the care I have been given,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:02.30,0:03:04.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,trusting you through all of it.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:05.75,0:03:06.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:06.29,0:03:08.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,for those living with an illness
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.75,0:03:10.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,that does not go away,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.44,0:03:11.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,the chronic pain,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:11.75,0:03:13.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,the long treatments,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.29,0:03:16.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,the bodies that never quite feel well,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.22,0:03:17.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,give endurance.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:17.56,0:03:20.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,On the days when hope runs thin,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:20.05,0:03:20.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,renew it.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:20.94,0:03:22.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let them know that their
Dialogue: 4,0:03:22.71,0:03:24.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,worth is not measured by
Dialogue: 4,0:03:24.48,0:03:26.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,what their body can do.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.56,0:03:29.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let us be still.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:29.38,0:03:31.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.34,0:03:33.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,And breathe out.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.01,0:03:34.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Once more, breathe in,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:34.78,0:03:37.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let your body grow heavy.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:39.28,0:03:42.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Healing is not only for the body.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:42.39,0:03:44.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let us bring the heart
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.18,0:03:46.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the mind to God as well.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:48.14,0:03:48.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:48.75,0:03:51.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,heal the broken places in my heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:51.95,0:03:54.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,The losses I still grieve.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:54.41,0:03:56.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,The words that wounded me.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.75,0:04:00.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,The disappointments I never got over.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:00.17,0:04:01.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not have to hide
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,them from you.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.06,0:04:05.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bind up these wounds, Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.33,0:04:07.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,the way only you can.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:08.47,0:04:09.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,But he was wounded
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.77,0:04:11.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,for our transgressions,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:11.43,0:04:14.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,he was bruised for our iniquities:
Dialogue: 4,0:04:14.07,0:04:16.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,the chastisement of our
Dialogue: 4,0:04:16.10,0:04:17.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,peace was upon him;
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.96,0:04:20.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,and with his stripes we are healed.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.03,0:04:24.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before Jesus ever healed anyone,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:24.72,0:04:27.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,he chose to be wounded himself.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.50,0:04:30.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,He knows pain from the inside.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.14,0:04:31.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,So when you bring him
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.54,0:04:32.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,your pain tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:32.75,0:04:34.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,you are not bringing
Dialogue: 4,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,it to someone distant.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are bringing it
Dialogue: 4,0:04:37.09,0:04:39.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,to someone who understands.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, heal my anxious mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.97,0:04:46.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Quiet the questions that run in circles.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:46.20,0:04:48.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if the results are bad?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:48.60,0:04:51.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if it does not get better?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:51.06,0:04:53.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,I give you every what if.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.37,0:04:55.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Replace my fear with your peace,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.90,0:04:57.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let my mind rest
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,in you tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.04,0:05:00.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.42,0:05:02.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for every mind
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.01,0:05:04.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,that is tired and heavy tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:04.62,0:05:07.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,For depression that makes mornings hard.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:07.87,0:05:10.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,For anxiety that tightens the chest.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:10.95,0:05:12.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,For thoughts that feel
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.57,0:05:14.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,too dark to say out loud.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.59,0:05:17.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring light into those places.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:17.24,0:05:18.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lead each person
Dialogue: 4,0:05:18.47,0:05:20.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,to the help they need,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:20.17,0:05:22.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,the friend, the counsellor,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:22.24,0:05:23.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,the doctor,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let them never
Dialogue: 4,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,feel ashamed to ask.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:27.39,0:05:28.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be still,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:28.15,0:05:30.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,and know that I am God.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.78,0:05:33.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be still.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:33.11,0:05:35.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not because nothing is happening,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.62,0:05:37.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,but because God is still God,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.82,0:05:39.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,even in the dark,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,even in the hospital,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,even in the waiting.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:42.40,0:05:44.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your stillness tonight
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.06,0:05:45.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,is an act of trust.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.88,0:05:49.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Have mercy upon me, O LORD;
Dialogue: 5,0:05:49.81,0:05:51.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I am weak:
Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.54,0:05:53.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O LORD, heal me;
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.50,0:05:56.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,for my bones are vexed.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.37,0:05:59.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father, like David,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:59.10,0:06:01.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,I admit that I am weak.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:01.37,0:06:02.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have run out
Dialogue: 4,0:06:02.48,0:06:04.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,of my own strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:04.15,0:06:06.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Have mercy on me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:06.19,0:06:08.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meet me in the weakness.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:08.35,0:06:10.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Carry me where I cannot walk,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.44,0:06:12.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,and give me the strength
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.16,0:06:13.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,to face tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.77,0:06:17.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,For which cause we faint not;
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.32,0:06:20.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,but though our outward man perish,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:20.09,0:06:21.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,yet the inward man
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.56,0:06:23.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,is renewed day by day.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:25.03,0:06:27.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even when the body is struggling,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:27.38,0:06:29.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,something deeper can be renewed:
Dialogue: 4,0:06:29.84,0:06:31.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,your hope, your faith,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.45,0:06:33.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,your sense that you are loved.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.82,0:06:35.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,God is at work on the inside
Dialogue: 4,0:06:35.99,0:06:37.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,of you tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.16,0:06:39.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,whatever the outside feels like.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:41.02,0:06:41.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:41.39,0:06:43.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for everyone who cares
Dialogue: 4,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,for someone who is sick.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:45.47,0:06:48.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,The parents beside a child's bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.40,0:06:50.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,The husband or wife who has
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.47,0:06:52.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,not slept well in weeks.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.49,0:06:55.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,The children caring for aging parents.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:55.61,0:06:57.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give them strength,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.07,0:06:58.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,patience and rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:58.63,0:07:00.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let them know that what they do
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,is seen and treasured by you.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.00,0:07:04.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.53,0:07:07.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lift up every sick child tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:07.20,0:07:08.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,and every parent
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.43,0:07:10.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,who is afraid for them.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:10.36,0:07:12.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold these little ones close.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.72,0:07:13.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ease their fever,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:13.95,0:07:15.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,calm their fear,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.10,0:07:16.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,and bring them back
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.47,0:07:18.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,to playing and laughing.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.38,0:07:21.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give their parents peace and sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:22.28,0:07:22.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:22.82,0:07:24.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lift up the people I know
Dialogue: 4,0:07:24.89,0:07:26.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,who are ill tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.60,0:07:29.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring their names to you now,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:29.09,0:07:29.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,quietly.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:29.92,0:07:31.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Heal them.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:31.42,0:07:32.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Comfort them.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:32.98,0:07:35.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Surround them with people who love them,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:35.72,0:07:37.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let them feel your presence
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.84,0:07:40.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the long hours of the night.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:41.34,0:07:41.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:41.72,0:07:44.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,if bitterness or unforgiveness
Dialogue: 4,0:07:44.00,0:07:45.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,is weighing on me,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.36,0:07:47.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring it to you as well.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.52,0:07:49.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some wounds stay open
Dialogue: 4,0:07:49.15,0:07:51.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,because I keep holding them.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.51,0:07:52.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me to forgive,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:52.90,0:07:55.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,and to receive your forgiveness,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:55.24,0:07:56.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,so that my heart can
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.69,0:07:58.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,heal tonight too.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.32,0:08:00.47,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O LORD my God,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.47,0:08:01.95,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I cried unto thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:01.95,0:08:04.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and thou hast healed me.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.60,0:08:07.71,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Bless the LORD, O my soul,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.71,0:08:10.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and forget not all his benefits:
Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.48,0:08:13.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Who forgiveth all thine iniquities;
Dialogue: 5,0:08:13.28,0:08:16.32,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}who healeth all thy diseases.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.65,0:08:18.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:18.91,0:08:20.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,for every healing I have
Dialogue: 4,0:08:20.81,0:08:22.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,already received.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:22.33,0:08:24.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,The sicknesses that passed.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.64,0:08:26.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,The wounds that closed.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:26.85,0:08:29.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,The sorrows that lifted.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:29.18,0:08:31.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will not forget your benefits.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:31.86,0:08:33.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have been good to me,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.54,0:08:35.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I trust you to be good
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.29,0:08:36.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,to me tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.61,0:08:38.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for everyone
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.66,0:08:41.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,in a hospital bed tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:41.89,0:08:44.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,For those waiting for surgery,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:44.34,0:08:45.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,those in pain,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:45.48,0:08:47.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,those far from home,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.12,0:08:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,those afraid
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.10,0:08:50.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,of what the doctors will say.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.64,0:08:52.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sit beside each of them.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:52.96,0:08:55.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the beeping machines and the long
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.59,0:08:58.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,corridors be filled with your peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,And Lord, bless the nurses,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:01.53,0:09:03.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,doctors and carers working
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.46,0:09:05.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,through this night.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:05.06,0:09:07.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep them alert, kind and safe.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:07.99,0:09:10.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let their hands bring comfort,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.12,0:09:11.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,and refresh them when
Dialogue: 4,0:09:11.62,0:09:13.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,their shift is over.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.42,0:09:15.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,And Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:15.26,0:09:17.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,for anyone who is grieving tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.93,0:09:19.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,especially for someone
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.60,0:09:21.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,they could not save,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,hold them close.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Heal the ache of loss.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:24.62,0:09:26.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let them weep without shame,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:26.57,0:09:27.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let them feel
Dialogue: 4,0:09:27.75,0:09:30.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,that you are weeping with them.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.29,0:09:33.08,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And God shall wipe away
Dialogue: 5,0:09:33.08,0:09:35.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}all tears from their eyes;
Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.29,0:09:37.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and there shall be no more death,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.73,0:09:39.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither sorrow, nor crying,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.72,0:09:42.64,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither shall there be any more pain:
Dialogue: 4,0:09:42.64,0:09:45.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the former things are passed away.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.13,0:09:49.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is the promise beneath
Dialogue: 4,0:09:49.18,0:09:50.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,every other promise.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,One day God himself will
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.88,0:09:54.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,wipe away every tear.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.81,0:09:57.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pain will not have the last word.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:57.62,0:10:00.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Whatever healing you receive tonight
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.30,0:10:02.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,is a small taste of that day.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:03.84,0:10:04.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,O Lord my God,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.99,0:10:06.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cried unto thee,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.47,0:10:08.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,and thou hast healed me.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.62,0:10:10.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,David wrote that looking back
Dialogue: 4,0:10:10.66,0:10:12.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,on a night he thought he
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.34,0:10:13.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,would not survive.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:13.78,0:10:15.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,One day you may look
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.16,0:10:16.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,back on this night too,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:16.76,0:10:18.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,and see how God carried
Dialogue: 4,0:10:18.35,0:10:19.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,you through it.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:20.77,0:10:22.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,And we know that all things
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.70,0:10:24.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,work together for good
Dialogue: 4,0:10:24.27,0:10:25.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,to them that love God,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.84,0:10:27.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,to them who are the called
Dialogue: 4,0:10:27.70,0:10:29.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,according to his purpose.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.17,0:10:31.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.55,0:10:33.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not understand everything
Dialogue: 4,0:10:33.83,0:10:35.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am going through.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.45,0:10:37.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,But I choose to trust
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.17,0:10:38.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,that you are working,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:38.89,0:10:40.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,even here, even now.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.71,0:10:42.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me to wait with hope,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.42,0:10:44.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,and to see your goodness again
Dialogue: 4,0:10:44.39,0:10:46.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the land of the living.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:47.48,0:10:48.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.05,0:10:50.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me hope for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.33,0:10:52.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not a forced cheerfulness,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.24,0:10:53.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,but a quiet confidence
Dialogue: 4,0:10:53.86,0:10:55.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,that you are with me,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.40,0:10:57.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,whatever the morning brings.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:57.64,0:10:59.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me wake with new strength,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:59.80,0:11:01.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,and see your mercy again
Dialogue: 4,0:11:01.53,0:11:03.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,when the sun rises.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:04.28,0:11:07.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,And now, Lord, give me sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.00,0:11:07.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Deep,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.41,0:11:09.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,restoring sleep that lets
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.45,0:11:11.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,my body do the healing work
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.65,0:11:13.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,you designed it to do.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:13.62,0:11:14.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,If pain wakes me,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:14.98,0:11:17.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me feel your nearness.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:17.24,0:11:18.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,If fear wakes me,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.60,0:11:20.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me hear your peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:20.62,0:11:22.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,And let me fall asleep
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.31,0:11:24.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,again in your arms.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.16,0:11:26.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,I surrender my body,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:26.81,0:11:28.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,my heart and my future
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.63,0:11:30.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,to you tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:30.05,0:11:31.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not have to hold
Dialogue: 4,0:11:31.62,0:11:33.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,everything together.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.30,0:11:34.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,You hold me.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:34.87,0:11:37.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Into your hands I commit my spirit,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.89,0:11:39.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,as I rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:40.13,0:11:42.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in again, slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:42.51,0:11:44.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,And let it out.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:44.25,0:11:46.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let every muscle relax.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:46.62,0:11:48.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let God hold you.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:50.62,0:11:53.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Say these words with me quietly,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:53.23,0:11:54.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,as you rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.38,0:11:56.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord is my healer.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.63,0:11:59.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,He binds up my wounds.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:59.01,0:12:01.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am not alone in this bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.66,0:12:02.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,My body,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.37,0:12:04.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,my heart and my mind
Dialogue: 4,0:12:04.12,0:12:05.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,are in his hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.79,0:12:07.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will rest tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.30,0:12:09.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,and he will renew me.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.56,0:12:13.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,I laid me down and slept;
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.07,0:12:14.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,I awaked;
Dialogue: 5,0:12:14.59,0:12:17.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the LORD sustained me.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:18.47,0:12:20.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,I laid me down and slept;
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.98,0:12:22.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,I awaked;
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the Lord sustained me.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.90,0:12:27.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sleep itself is an act of trust.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:27.92,0:12:30.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,You let go of control for hours,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.23,0:12:32.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,and God keeps your heart beating
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.55,0:12:34.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,and your lungs breathing.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:34.54,0:12:35.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:35.15,0:12:37.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,he will sustain you again.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:38.52,0:12:41.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here is one thing to do tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:41.39,0:12:43.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Place your hand where it hurts,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.64,0:12:45.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,or over your heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:45.02,0:12:47.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,and pray just three words:
Dialogue: 4,0:12:47.10,0:12:48.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, heal me.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:48.83,0:12:50.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then leave it with him,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:50.49,0:12:52.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let yourself sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.52,0:12:55.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you prayed this prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:55.48,0:12:57.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,type amen in the comments now,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:57.74,0:12:58.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and if you want,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:58.94,0:13:00.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,share the name of someone
Dialogue: 4,0:13:00.82,0:13:02.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,who needs healing,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:02.18,0:13:04.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,so others can pray too.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:04.09,0:13:06.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then stay right where you are.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:06.64,0:13:08.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,For the rest of this time,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.58,0:13:09.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will read healing
Dialogue: 4,0:13:09.99,0:13:11.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Scripture over you slowly,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.93,0:13:13.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,so you can fall
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.05,0:13:14.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,asleep in God's care.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.80,0:13:18.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let us begin by letting
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.71,0:13:20.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,your body settle.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.30,0:13:21.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in gently,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:21.75,0:13:24.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,as deeply as is comfortable for you,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:24.63,0:13:27.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let the breath go slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.14,0:13:28.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,If there is pain,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:28.54,0:13:30.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,do not fight it.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:30.03,0:13:31.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Just notice it,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.26,0:13:33.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,and place it in God's hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.73,0:13:35.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your face soften.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:35.85,0:13:38.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your eyes close.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:39.17,0:13:41.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your shoulders drop.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:41.34,0:13:42.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your arms rest
Dialogue: 4,0:13:42.76,0:13:44.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,heavy at your sides.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:44.52,0:13:46.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your hands open.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:46.62,0:13:48.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Feel the mattress holding you,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:48.78,0:13:51.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,the pillow supporting your head.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:51.26,0:13:53.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to hold
Dialogue: 4,0:13:53.01,0:13:54.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,yourself up tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.70,0:13:56.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are held.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:57.52,0:13:59.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the warmth of rest spread
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.68,0:14:01.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,slowly through your chest,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:01.62,0:14:03.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,your stomach, your hips,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:03.41,0:14:04.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,your legs,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:04.15,0:14:06.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,all the way down to your feet.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:06.57,0:14:08.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every part of you is known
Dialogue: 4,0:14:08.64,0:14:10.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,by the God who made you.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.74,0:14:13.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every cell is in his care.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:13.10,0:14:14.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest now.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:15.80,0:14:18.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now let the day itself go.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:18.34,0:14:19.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,The appointments,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:19.52,0:14:20.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,the phone calls,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:20.62,0:14:22.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,the waiting rooms, the worry.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:22.79,0:14:24.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let each one drift away
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.68,0:14:26.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,like a leaf on slow water.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:26.98,0:14:28.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is nothing more
Dialogue: 4,0:14:28.50,0:14:30.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,you need to do today.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.19,0:14:30.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.87,0:14:33.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,your only task is to rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:34.45,0:14:35.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Listen to this psalm
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.93,0:14:37.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,of healing and mercy.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:37.66,0:14:40.19,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Bless the LORD, O my soul:
Dialogue: 5,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and all that is within me,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.26,0:14:44.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}bless his holy name.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:44.04,0:14:46.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Bless the LORD, O my soul,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:46.14,0:14:48.91,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and forget not all his benefits:
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.91,0:14:51.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Who forgiveth all thine iniquities;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.72,0:14:54.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}who healeth all thy diseases;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.58,0:14:57.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Who redeemeth thy life from destruction;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.84,0:15:00.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}who crowneth thee with lovingkindness
Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.58,0:15:02.18,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and tender mercies;
Dialogue: 5,0:15:02.18,0:15:03.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Who satisfieth thy
Dialogue: 5,0:15:03.58,0:15:05.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}mouth with good things;
Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.56,0:15:07.70,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}so that thy youth is renewed
Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.70,0:15:09.19,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}like the eagle's.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.19,0:15:12.08,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is merciful and gracious,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}slow to anger,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.27,0:15:15.41,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and plenteous in mercy.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.41,0:15:17.83,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He will not always chide:
Dialogue: 5,0:15:17.83,0:15:19.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither will he keep
Dialogue: 5,0:15:19.40,0:15:21.08,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his anger for ever.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:21.08,0:15:22.43,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He hath not dealt
Dialogue: 5,0:15:22.43,0:15:24.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}with us after our sins;
Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.44,0:15:26.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor rewarded us according
Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.50,0:15:28.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to our iniquities.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.16,0:15:29.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For as the heaven
Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.50,0:15:31.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is high above the earth,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.38,0:15:33.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}so great is his mercy
Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.03,0:15:35.25,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}toward them that fear him.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.25,0:15:36.63,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}As far as the east
Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.63,0:15:37.93,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is from the west,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.93,0:15:39.92,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}so far hath he removed our
Dialogue: 5,0:15:39.92,0:15:41.85,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}transgressions from us.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.85,0:15:44.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Like as a father pitieth his children,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:44.72,0:15:46.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}so the LORD pitieth
Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.16,0:15:47.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}them that fear him.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:48.97,0:15:52.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Like as a father pitieth his children.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:52.10,0:15:54.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Think of a loving father sitting
Dialogue: 4,0:15:54.46,0:15:57.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside a sick child's bed at night,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.04,0:15:59.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,watching, caring, staying.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:59.14,0:16:00.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,That is how God
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.33,0:16:02.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,is with you tonight.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.30,0:16:05.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is my shepherd;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:05.48,0:16:07.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I shall not want.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:07.37,0:16:08.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He maketh me to lie
Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.94,0:16:11.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}down in green pastures:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.03,0:16:14.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he leadeth me beside the still waters.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.22,0:16:16.53,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He restoreth my soul:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:16.53,0:16:18.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he leadeth me in the paths
Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.57,0:16:21.66,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of righteousness for his name's sake.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.66,0:16:21.95,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Yea,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.95,0:16:24.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}though I walk through the valley
Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.27,0:16:25.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the shadow of death,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will fear no evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.58,0:16:29.85,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for thou art with me;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy rod and thy staff
Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.60,0:16:33.12,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they comfort me.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.12,0:16:35.71,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou preparest a table before me
Dialogue: 5,0:16:35.71,0:16:38.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in the presence of mine enemies:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.48,0:16:41.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou anointest my head with oil;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.38,0:16:43.43,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my cup runneth over.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.43,0:16:45.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Surely goodness and mercy shall
Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}follow me all the
Dialogue: 5,0:16:47.38,0:16:48.88,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}days of my life:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.88,0:16:51.01,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will dwell in the house
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.01,0:16:52.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the LORD for ever.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:53.93,0:16:56.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,He restoreth my soul.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Restoring is slow, quiet work,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:58.66,0:17:00.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,the kind that often
Dialogue: 4,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,happens while we sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:02.25,0:17:04.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the shepherd do his restoring
Dialogue: 4,0:17:04.52,0:17:06.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,work in you tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:07.28,0:17:09.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,God is our refuge and strength,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:09.81,0:17:12.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,a very present help in trouble.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:12.53,0:17:14.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Therefore will not we fear,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:14.46,0:17:16.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,though the earth be removed,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:16.45,0:17:18.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and though the mountains be carried
Dialogue: 4,0:17:18.94,0:17:20.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the midst of the sea;
Dialogue: 4,0:17:20.97,0:17:22.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Though the waters thereof
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.62,0:17:24.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,roar and be troubled,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:24.01,0:17:25.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,though the mountains shake
Dialogue: 4,0:17:25.73,0:17:27.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the swelling thereof.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:27.64,0:17:28.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be still,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:28.38,0:17:30.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,and know that I am God:
Dialogue: 4,0:17:30.48,0:17:33.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will be exalted among the heathen,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:33.29,0:17:35.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will be exalted in the earth.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:35.89,0:17:38.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD of hosts is with us;
Dialogue: 4,0:17:38.42,0:17:41.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,the God of Jacob is our refuge.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:42.72,0:17:45.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord of hosts is with us.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:45.31,0:17:48.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even when the body feels fragile
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.06,0:17:50.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the future uncertain,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:50.21,0:17:52.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,the God of angel armies
Dialogue: 4,0:17:52.19,0:17:54.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,is beside your bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:54.00,0:17:55.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be still.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:55.33,0:17:56.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,He is God,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:56.22,0:17:58.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you can rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:59.12,0:18:01.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:01.07,0:18:02.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,And let it go.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:02.81,0:18:04.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest in the quiet.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.76,0:18:08.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}But now thus saith the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:18:08.97,0:18:10.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that created thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.44,0:18:11.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O Jacob,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.10,0:18:13.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he that formed thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:13.06,0:18:14.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O Israel, Fear not:
Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.79,0:18:16.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I have redeemed thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.72,0:18:19.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I have called thee by thy name;
Dialogue: 5,0:18:19.30,0:18:21.12,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou art mine.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.12,0:18:23.80,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}When thou passest through the waters,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:23.80,0:18:25.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will be with thee;
Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.42,0:18:27.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and through the rivers,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:27.06,0:18:29.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they shall not overflow thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:18:29.29,0:18:31.89,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}when thou walkest through the fire,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:31.89,0:18:33.93,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou shalt not be burned;
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.93,0:18:35.78,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither shall the flame
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}kindle upon thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:38.53,0:18:41.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,When thou passest through the waters,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:41.16,0:18:42.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will be with thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:42.77,0:18:45.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Illness can feel like deep water.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:45.66,0:18:47.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,But God does not watch
Dialogue: 4,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,from the shore.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:48.70,0:18:50.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,He walks through it with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:50.80,0:18:52.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are his.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:52.42,0:18:54.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,He knows your name.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:55.56,0:18:58.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,For which cause we faint not;
Dialogue: 4,0:18:58.10,0:19:00.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,but though our outward man perish,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:00.88,0:19:02.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,yet the inward man
Dialogue: 4,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,is renewed day by day.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:04.32,0:19:06.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,For our light affliction,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:06.25,0:19:08.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,which is but for a moment,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:08.26,0:19:10.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,worketh for us a far more exceeding
Dialogue: 4,0:19:10.97,0:19:13.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,and eternal weight of glory;
Dialogue: 4,0:19:13.31,0:19:15.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,While we look not at the things
Dialogue: 4,0:19:15.46,0:19:16.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,which are seen,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:16.49,0:19:17.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,but at the things
Dialogue: 4,0:19:17.67,0:19:19.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,which are not seen:
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the things which
Dialogue: 4,0:19:20.60,0:19:22.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,are seen are temporal;
Dialogue: 4,0:19:22.35,0:19:23.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,but the things which
Dialogue: 4,0:19:23.88,0:19:26.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,are not seen are eternal.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:27.17,0:19:30.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,The things which are seen are temporal.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:30.18,0:19:32.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,The pain you feel tonight is real,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:32.87,0:19:35.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,but it is not the whole story,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:35.23,0:19:37.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,and it is not forever.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:37.15,0:19:37.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Beneath it,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:37.99,0:19:39.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,God is renewing the part
Dialogue: 4,0:19:39.83,0:19:41.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,of you that lasts.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:42.58,0:19:43.64,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I had fainted,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.64,0:19:45.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}unless I had believed to see
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.74,0:19:47.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the goodness of the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:19:47.54,0:19:49.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in the land of the living.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.68,0:19:51.65,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Wait on the LORD:
Dialogue: 5,0:19:51.65,0:19:53.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be of good courage,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.75,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he shall strengthen thine heart:
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.75,0:19:58.21,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}wait, I say, on the LORD.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:59.24,0:20:01.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,To see the goodness of the Lord
Dialogue: 4,0:20:01.42,0:20:03.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the land of the living.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:03.44,0:20:05.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not only someday, but here,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:05.57,0:20:06.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,in this life,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:06.60,0:20:08.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the days ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:08.20,0:20:10.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Wait on the Lord tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,and be of good courage.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:11.99,0:20:14.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,He will strengthen your heart.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:15.54,0:20:16.93,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I sought the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.93,0:20:18.17,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he heard me,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.17,0:20:21.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and delivered me from all my fears.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.06,0:20:22.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O taste and see
Dialogue: 5,0:20:22.27,0:20:24.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that the LORD is good:
Dialogue: 5,0:20:24.22,0:20:25.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}blessed is the man
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.56,0:20:27.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that trusteth in him.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.30,0:20:29.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is nigh unto them
Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.27,0:20:31.49,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that are of a broken heart;
Dialogue: 4,0:20:31.49,0:20:33.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,and saveth such as
Dialogue: 4,0:20:33.02,0:20:35.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,be of a contrite spirit.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:36.44,0:20:38.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord is nigh unto them
Dialogue: 4,0:20:38.44,0:20:40.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,that are of a broken heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:40.69,0:20:43.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,If your heart is broken tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:43.32,0:20:45.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,you are not far from God.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:45.54,0:20:48.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are exactly where he comes closest.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.87,0:20:52.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your breathing slow even more.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:52.80,0:20:54.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are safe.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:54.43,0:20:55.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will lift up mine
Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.06,0:21:00.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}eyes unto the hills,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:00.62,0:21:02.91,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}from whence cometh my help.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:02.91,0:21:05.02,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}My help cometh from the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.02,0:21:07.23,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which made heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.23,0:21:08.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He will not suffer
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.56,0:21:10.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy foot to be moved:
Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.29,0:21:13.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he that keepeth thee will not slumber.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.29,0:21:13.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Behold,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.79,0:21:15.80,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he that keepeth Israel shall
Dialogue: 5,0:21:15.80,0:21:17.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither slumber nor sleep.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.84,0:21:20.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is thy keeper:
Dialogue: 5,0:21:20.11,0:21:21.77,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the LORD is thy shade
Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.77,0:21:23.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}upon thy right hand.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:23.54,0:21:24.55,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The sun shall
Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.55,0:21:26.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}not smite thee by day,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:26.26,0:21:28.15,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor the moon by night.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.15,0:21:29.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.87,0:21:31.47,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thee from all evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:21:31.47,0:21:34.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he shall preserve thy soul.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:34.06,0:21:35.99,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve thy
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.99,0:21:37.70,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}going out and thy coming
Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.70,0:21:39.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in from this time forth,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:39.42,0:21:41.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and even for evermore.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:42.37,0:21:45.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,He that keepeth thee will not slumber.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:45.35,0:21:47.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Through every hour of this night,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:47.76,0:21:48.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,while you rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:48.86,0:21:51.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,God is awake and watching over you.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:51.61,0:21:53.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let go.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:53.41,0:21:55.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,He will not.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:56.22,0:21:58.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be careful for nothing;
Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.36,0:22:00.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}but in every thing by prayer
Dialogue: 5,0:22:00.38,0:22:03.13,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and supplication with thanksgiving let
Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.13,0:22:05.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}your requests be made known unto God.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:05.98,0:22:07.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And the peace of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:07.57,0:22:09.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which passeth all understanding,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.98,0:22:11.64,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall keep your hearts
Dialogue: 5,0:22:11.64,0:22:14.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and minds through Christ Jesus.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:15.36,0:22:17.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,The peace of God shall
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.04,0:22:18.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep your heart and mind,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:18.94,0:22:21.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,like a guard at the door.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:21.03,0:22:23.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Whatever news tomorrow brings,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.29,0:22:24.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,tonight that peace
Dialogue: 4,0:22:24.64,0:22:26.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,stands watch over you.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.68,0:22:30.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou wilt keep him in perfect peace,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:30.52,0:22:33.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}whose mind is stayed on thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.00,0:22:35.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}because he trusteth in thee.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:35.38,0:22:37.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Trust ye in the LORD for ever:
Dialogue: 5,0:22:37.90,0:22:39.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for in the LORD JEHOVAH
Dialogue: 5,0:22:39.81,0:22:42.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is everlasting strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.19,0:22:44.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perfect peace for a mind
Dialogue: 4,0:22:44.99,0:22:46.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,stayed on him.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:46.22,0:22:48.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you drift toward sleep,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,let your last thought rest on God,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:50.78,0:22:52.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,his kindness, his nearness,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:52.83,0:22:54.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,his strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:54.00,0:22:56.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Everlasting strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:56.08,0:22:58.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,It does not run out.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:59.27,0:23:01.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,He healeth the broken in heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:01.72,0:23:04.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,and bindeth up their wounds.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:04.10,0:23:07.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,He telleth the number of the stars;
Dialogue: 4,0:23:07.08,0:23:09.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,he calleth them all by their names.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:09.94,0:23:11.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Great is our Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:11.47,0:23:13.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,and of great power:
Dialogue: 4,0:23:13.26,0:23:16.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,his understanding is infinite.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:17.24,0:23:19.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Above your roof tonight there
Dialogue: 4,0:23:19.42,0:23:22.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,are more stars than anyone can count,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:22.19,0:23:23.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,and God calls every
Dialogue: 4,0:23:23.62,0:23:25.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,one of them by name.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:25.30,0:23:27.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,The same God is binding
Dialogue: 4,0:23:27.25,0:23:28.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,up your wounds.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:28.70,0:23:30.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nothing about you is too
Dialogue: 4,0:23:30.47,0:23:31.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,small for his care,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:31.87,0:23:33.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,and nothing about your pain
Dialogue: 4,0:23:33.87,0:23:36.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,is too big for his power.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:37.10,0:23:38.64,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}But thou, O LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:38.64,0:23:40.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}art a shield for me;
Dialogue: 5,0:23:40.62,0:23:41.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my glory,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:41.33,0:23:43.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and the lifter up of mine head.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:43.94,0:23:45.64,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I cried unto the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:23:45.64,0:23:46.77,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}with my voice,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:46.77,0:23:48.31,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he heard me out
Dialogue: 5,0:23:48.31,0:23:49.86,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of his holy hill.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:49.86,0:23:52.36,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I laid me down and slept;
Dialogue: 5,0:23:52.36,0:23:53.89,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I awaked;
Dialogue: 5,0:23:53.89,0:23:56.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the LORD sustained me.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:57.47,0:23:59.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,The lifter up of mine head.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:59.89,0:24:01.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,When illness or sorrow
Dialogue: 4,0:24:01.71,0:24:03.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,bows your head low,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:03.28,0:24:05.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,God gently lifts it again.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:05.61,0:24:07.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lay your head down now.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:07.78,0:24:09.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,He will lift it up
Dialogue: 4,0:24:09.13,0:24:10.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the morning.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:11.63,0:24:13.80,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He that dwelleth in the secret
Dialogue: 5,0:24:13.80,0:24:16.25,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}place of the most High shall abide
Dialogue: 5,0:24:16.25,0:24:18.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}under the shadow of the Almighty.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:18.81,0:24:20.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will say of the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:20.74,0:24:23.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He is my refuge and my fortress:
Dialogue: 5,0:24:23.60,0:24:25.08,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my God;
Dialogue: 5,0:24:25.08,0:24:27.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in him will I trust.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:27.24,0:24:29.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He shall cover thee with his feathers,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:29.90,0:24:32.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and under his wings shalt thou trust:
Dialogue: 5,0:24:32.67,0:24:34.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his truth shall be thy
Dialogue: 5,0:24:34.30,0:24:35.88,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shield and buckler.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:35.88,0:24:38.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Because thou hast made the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:38.48,0:24:40.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which is my refuge,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:40.03,0:24:41.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}even the most High,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:41.57,0:24:42.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy habitation;
Dialogue: 5,0:24:42.97,0:24:45.32,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}There shall no evil befall thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:45.32,0:24:47.09,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither shall any plague
Dialogue: 5,0:24:47.09,0:24:48.96,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}come nigh thy dwelling.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:48.96,0:24:51.09,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For he shall give his angels
Dialogue: 5,0:24:51.09,0:24:52.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}charge over thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:52.38,0:24:54.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to keep thee in all thy ways.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:55.97,0:24:57.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, as sleep comes,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:57.74,0:24:59.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,I give you my body,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:59.34,0:25:01.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,my heart and my mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:01.29,0:25:03.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Heal what needs healing.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:03.52,0:25:05.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Comfort what needs comfort.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:05.87,0:25:08.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Watch over me through the night,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:08.04,0:25:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let me wake to your mercy
Dialogue: 4,0:25:10.00,0:25:11.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:12.39,0:25:13.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,And now receive this
Dialogue: 4,0:25:13.90,0:25:15.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,blessing as you sleep.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:15.73,0:25:16.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Beloved,
Dialogue: 5,0:25:16.37,0:25:19.02,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I wish above all things that thou
Dialogue: 5,0:25:19.02,0:25:21.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}mayest prosper and be in health,
Dialogue: 5,0:25:21.59,0:25:24.02,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}even as thy soul prospereth.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:24.02,0:25:26.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest in his care tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:26.16,0:25:28.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,In Jesus' name, amen.
